What you’re trying to build is doable—but the tricky part isn’t the UI, it’s filtering + routing + saving per Section/User correctly. Let’s break it into a clean, working approach based on your SharePoint structure.


---

🧠 Overall Concept

You want:

A link per Section (e.g., PR PROC)

Only the assigned users (Section Incharge) can answer

A matrix UI:

Supplier Code | Supplier Name | Question1 | Question2 ...
                                   ○1 ○2 ○3   ○1 ○2 ○3 ○4

