---

🔗 1. Pass Section via Link (IMPORTANT)

When you send the link, use:

https://apps.powerapps.com/play/...&Section=PR PROC


---

📌 2. Capture Section in Power Apps

In App → OnStart:

Set(varSection, Param("Section"));

In Screen → OnVisible:

Set(varUser, User().Email);


---

🔐 3. Restrict Access (SE Access List)

Only allow users assigned to the section:

If(
    IsBlank(
        LookUp(
            'SE Access List',
            Section.Value = varSection &&
            User.Email = varUser
        )
    ),
    Notify("You are not authorized for this section", NotificationType.Error);
    Navigate(Screen_Denied)
)


---

📊 4. Load Data (Core Logic)

Suppliers (filtered by section)

ClearCollect(
    colSuppliers,
    Filter('SE Supplier List', Section.Value = varSection)
);

Questions (filtered by Section Incharge)

ClearCollect(
    colQuestions,
    Filter('SE Question List', Section Incharge.Value = varSection)
);


