💾 4. CAPTURE ANSWERS (CRITICAL)

Radio → OnSelect

// Remove existing answer for same Supplier + Question
RemoveIf(
    colAnswers,
    SupplierID = ThisItem.Parent.Parent.ID &&
    QuestionID = ThisItem.ID
);

// Add new answer
Collect(
    colAnswers,
    {
        SupplierID: ThisItem.Parent.Parent.ID,
        QuestionID: ThisItem.ID,
        Score: Radio_Score.Selected.Value
    }
);

👉 Explanation:

Parent.Parent = Supplier row

ThisItem = Question



